  "details": "From what I gather on the discord several people have this issue, where if you invite too many people to your group (for example your discord server people) the safety system sees it as malicious API use with a temp suspension.\n\nThis happens using the invite function on the group on the website itself, so not a script abuse scenario.\n\nI believe there should be a message saying that you hit your invite limit or something instead and just stop letting you invite on a cooldown.",
